  "description": "Google Gemini provider for Themia.AI's IAiCompletionProvider. Maps Gemini's finishReason and HTTP status onto AiOutcome, reads usageMetadata on every response that carries it, and sends the API key as an x-goog-api-key header rather than a query parameter, so it is never part of a request URI; IHttpClientFactory's default request logging is suppressed for this client as defence in depth.",
